sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Incident as Incident
    participant EventBus
    Client->>+Incident: report(eventId, severity, category, description, prepTaskId, deliveryId, shiftId)
    Note over Incident: Policies: incidentRead, incidentWrite, incidentExecute
    Note over Incident: Guards (5)
    Incident->>Incident: guard[0]: self.reportedAt == null
    Incident->>Incident: guard[1]: self.status == #quot;open#quot;
    Incident->>Incident: guard[2]: self.deletedAt == null
    Incident->>Incident: guard[3]: self.event != null
    Incident->>Incident: guard[4]: user.id != null
    Incident->>Incident: mutate.eventId
    Incident->>Incident: mutate.prepTaskId
    Incident->>Incident: mutate.deliveryId
    Incident->>Incident: mutate.shiftId
    Incident->>Incident: mutate.severity
    Incident->>Incident: mutate.category
    Incident->>Incident: mutate.description
    Incident->>Incident: mutate.correctiveActionRequired
    Incident->>Incident: mutate.reportedById
    Incident->>Incident: mutate.reportedAt
    Incident->>EventBus: emit IncidentReported on incident.reported
    Incident-->>-Client: void